、能力联动、程序化环境、界面和调试。原创 Oinja 世界、创作方向和试玩反馈由作者提供；作品经过多轮会话和修改。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · Rapier 3D · TypeScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[141,142,143,144],{"_62":175,"_25":82,"_17":131},{"_62":125,"_25":126,"_17":120,"_109":127},{"_62":172,"_25":117,"_173":174,"_109":118},{"_62":171,"_25":82,"_109":110},[169,170],"codex","threejs","Read the creator’s Codex contribution statement","Open the complete survival-game project","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s development account",{"_177":178},"documents",{"_74":179,"_35":180},[182,186,187,188,185,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,184,221,183,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242],[181,182,183,184,185],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","editorial-art-prompts","skills/level-design/reference